WEBVTT

00:00.025 --> 00:02.473
<i>[cheery music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:02.542 --> 00:09.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.404 --> 00:13.646
[strained grunting]
[紧张的咕哝声]

00:17.853 --> 00:20.232
Errgh.
Phew...
呃。
呼……

00:20.301 --> 00:24.784
Karen, can you give me a hand
with my new doodadatron?
凯伦，你能帮我一下吗
和我的新 doodadatron 一起吗？

00:24.853 --> 00:28.577
Sorry, Sheldon, I'm off
to visit my motherboard.
抱歉，谢尔顿，我要走了
访问我的主板。

00:28.646 --> 00:30.887
[gasps]
Wait!
[喘气]
等等！

00:30.956 --> 00:33.680
How am I supposed to get
anything done without you?
我该如何得到
没有你，什么事都完成了？

00:33.749 --> 00:35.025
Don't worry.
不用担心。

00:35.094 --> 00:38.094
I put up help wanted flyers
for an intern.
我张贴了招聘传单
对于实习生来说。

00:38.163 --> 00:39.784
See?
看？

00:39.853 --> 00:41.577
[grunts]
[咕哝]

00:41.646 --> 00:43.197
Ugh.
啊。

00:43.266 --> 00:45.301
Ooh!
"Intern wanted.
哦！
“想要实习生。

00:45.370 --> 00:48.473
Apply today
at Chum Bucket Labs"?!
今天申请
在 Chum Bucket 实验室”？！

00:48.542 --> 00:51.370
[groans]
I'm a mad scientist!
[呻吟]
我是一个疯狂的科学家！

00:51.439 --> 00:52.749
If getting help was that easy,
如果获得帮助有那么容易的话

00:52.818 --> 00:54.749
I wouldn't have built
a computer wife!
我不会建造
电脑老婆！

00:54.818 --> 00:57.715
Is this where I apply
for the intern job?
这是我申请的地方吗
实习生工作？

00:57.784 --> 00:59.956
[surprised grunts]
[惊讶的咕哝声]

01:00.025 --> 01:02.163
Meh.
嗯。

01:02.232 --> 01:03.473
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

01:03.542 --> 01:06.508
Hello and welcome
to Chum Bucket Labs!
您好，欢迎光临
前往 Chum Bucket 实验室！

01:06.577 --> 01:08.266
As an intern, you will gain
作为实习生，你将收获

01:08.335 --> 01:11.680
valuable work experience
at a sub-minimum wage.
宝贵的工作经验
低于最低工资。

01:11.749 --> 01:15.404
- [all grumbling]
- Oh, of course.
- [全都抱怨]
- 哦，当然。

01:15.473 --> 01:17.266
Well, that narrowed it down.
嗯，这缩小了范围。

01:17.335 --> 01:19.335
I wanna do the science!
我想做科学！

01:19.404 --> 01:21.646
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

01:21.715 --> 01:23.439
Ah, boy.
啊，男孩。

01:24.680 --> 01:28.887
Okay, let's see how you handle
scientific equipment.
好吧，看你怎么处理
科学设备。

01:28.956 --> 01:30.715
This is my duplimaker.
这是我的复印机。

01:30.784 --> 01:32.335
It's very, very simple.
这非常非常简单。

01:32.404 --> 01:34.128
Oh, like me!
哦，像我一样！

01:34.197 --> 01:36.991
Just put this coin
in the chamber...
只要把这个硬币
房间里……

01:37.059 --> 01:38.646
- Gotcha!
- [screams]
- 明白了！
- [尖叫]

01:38.715 --> 01:42.059
No!
Just the coin, you idiot!
不！
只是硬币，你这个白痴！

01:42.128 --> 01:43.542
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:43.611 --> 01:46.094
<i>[chaotic music]
[electronic bubbling]</i>
<i>[混乱的音乐]
[电子冒泡]</i>

01:46.163 --> 01:47.818
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:47.887 --> 01:50.059
[duplimaker beeping]
[复印机发出嘟嘟声]

01:50.128 --> 01:51.370
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:51.439 --> 01:53.646
- [screaming]
- [panting]
- [尖叫]
- [气喘吁吁]

01:53.715 --> 01:55.335
Ooh!
哦！

01:55.404 --> 01:57.611
all: Do we get the job?
所有人：我们得到这份工作了吗？

01:57.680 --> 02:00.404
I'll tell you what you get.
我会告诉你你会得到什么。

02:00.473 --> 02:04.197
You get out!
[buzzer blares]
你出去吧！
[蜂鸣器鸣响]

02:04.266 --> 02:07.335
[Patricks grunting]
[帕特里克斯咕哝]

02:07.404 --> 02:10.266
- Hi, I'm Patrick.
- No, I'm Patrick.
- 嗨，我是帕特里克。
- 不，我是帕特里克。

02:10.335 --> 02:11.922
Who's Patrick?
帕特里克是谁？

02:11.991 --> 02:14.094
[sighs] Great.
[叹气]太好了。

02:14.163 --> 02:16.335
Not a single applicant left.
没有一个申请者离开。

02:16.404 --> 02:19.059
Hello?
I'm still here.
你好？
我还在这里。

02:19.128 --> 02:22.577
Whale!
鲸！

02:22.646 --> 02:23.887
No, not you!
[steps thudding]
不，不是你！
[脚步声重重]

02:23.956 --> 02:25.887
Whales eat plankton.
鲸鱼吃浮游生物。

02:25.956 --> 02:29.473
I don't eat plankton.
That's baby food.
我不吃浮游生物。
那是婴儿食品。

02:29.542 --> 02:31.266
I'm just here for the job.
我只是为了工作而来的。

02:31.335 --> 02:33.059
Really?
真的吗？

02:33.128 --> 02:34.715
You're not gonna eat me?
你不打算吃掉我吗？

02:34.784 --> 02:36.232
Ew, no.
呃，不。

02:36.301 --> 02:37.784
I just need money,
我只需要钱，

02:37.853 --> 02:40.473
but my dad's such a skinflint
with my allowance.
但我爸爸就是个吝啬的人
用我的零用钱。

02:40.542 --> 02:42.404
All right, you're hired. Whatever.
好吧，你被录用了。任何。

02:42.473 --> 02:43.853
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

02:43.922 --> 02:47.680
As the Junior Intern
of Chum Bucket Labs,
作为初级实习生
Chum Bucket 实验室，

02:47.749 --> 02:51.197
you're responsible
for extremely-important tasks.
你有责任
用于极其重要的任务。

02:51.266 --> 02:54.197
Oh wow! [giggles]
Like what?
哦哇！ [咯咯笑]
比如什么？

02:54.266 --> 02:55.715
Ugh.
啊。

02:55.784 --> 02:58.680
You make an excellent ladder,
Junior Intern.
你做了一个很棒的梯子，
初级实习生。

02:58.749 --> 03:02.197
Yes!
My evil robot is complete!
是的！
我的邪恶机器人完成了！

03:02.266 --> 03:03.853
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:03.922 --> 03:05.404
<i>[mischievous music]</i>
<i>[恶作剧音乐]</i>

03:05.473 --> 03:08.232
Ow!
[robot whirs]
噢！
[机器人呼呼]

03:08.301 --> 03:12.749
Nothing can stop me now!
现在没有什么可以阻止我了！

03:12.818 --> 03:13.991
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:14.059 --> 03:16.611
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

03:16.680 --> 03:19.370
Except that tiny doorway.
除了那个小门口。

03:19.439 --> 03:22.922
No one asked you, Junior Intern.
没有人问你，初级实习生。

03:22.991 --> 03:24.542
By the way,
顺便一提，

03:24.611 --> 03:28.301
I forgot to give you
your very own lab instrument.
我忘了给你
您自己的实验室仪器。

03:28.370 --> 03:30.887
Ooh!
What's it do?
哦！
它是做什么的？

03:30.956 --> 03:32.232
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

03:32.301 --> 03:35.473
Why don't you push it around
and find out?
你为什么不把它推来推去
并找出答案？

03:36.784 --> 03:39.577
Observe,
my lowly intern, and tremble
观察，
我卑微的实习生，颤抖

03:39.646 --> 03:44.439
at the power of my mighty,
uh, laser thingy.
以我强大的力量，
呃，激光的东西。

03:44.508 --> 03:47.163
It'll blow the door
off a safe...
会炸门的
关掉保险柜...

03:47.232 --> 03:48.577
[chuckles]
[笑声]

03:49.611 --> 03:51.646
[soft pew]
[laser warps]
[软座位]
[激光扭曲]

03:51.715 --> 03:53.197
<i>[downtrodden music]</i>
<i>[受压迫的音乐]</i>

03:53.266 --> 03:56.094
Ugh, and everything in it.
呃，还有里面的一切。

03:56.163 --> 03:58.577
Get to work, intern.
实习生，开始工作吧。

03:58.646 --> 04:00.508
Okay.
好的。

04:02.370 --> 04:06.025
Behold my instant monster maker!
看我的即时怪物制造者！

04:06.094 --> 04:08.335
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:08.404 --> 04:10.301
Wah!
哇！

04:10.370 --> 04:12.163
<i>[chaotic music]</i>
<i>[混乱的音乐]</i>

04:12.232 --> 04:14.680
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

04:14.749 --> 04:15.956
Yes!
是的！

04:16.025 --> 04:18.266
A creature strong enough
to rip open a safe
足够强大的生物
撕开保险箱

04:18.335 --> 04:20.094
with its bare hands...
徒手...

04:20.163 --> 04:21.853
Tentacles.
触手。

04:21.922 --> 04:24.128
Bare tentacles.
Even worse!
裸露的触手。
更糟糕的是！

04:24.197 --> 04:26.473
[maniacal laugh]
[grunts]
[疯狂的笑声]
[咕哝]

04:26.542 --> 04:29.059
[screaming]
- [shrieking]
[尖叫]
- [尖叫]

04:30.991 --> 04:33.404
[soft pew]
[软座位]

04:36.853 --> 04:40.370
Ew, gross!
呃，恶心！

04:40.439 --> 04:42.197
Don't bother sweeping it up.
不用费心去扫它。

04:42.266 --> 04:43.646
Thanks, Mr. Plankton.
谢谢，浮游生物先生。

04:43.715 --> 04:45.991
Your gonna need a mop.
你需要一个拖把。

04:46.059 --> 04:47.956
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:48.025 --> 04:50.404
[moans]
[呻吟声]

04:50.473 --> 04:52.025
[moans]
[呻吟声]

04:52.094 --> 04:55.370
Aww, how was your first day
at your summer job, sweetie?
哇，你第一天过得怎么样
亲爱的，你的暑假工作吗？

04:55.439 --> 04:57.197
It's so boring!
真无聊啊！

04:57.266 --> 05:00.404
My boss doesn't let me
do any of the fun stuff.
我的老板不让我
做任何有趣的事情。

05:00.473 --> 05:02.370
Now, now, my little cetacean.
现在，现在，我的小鲸类动物。

05:02.439 --> 05:04.025
Work ain't supposed to be fun.
工作不应该是有趣的。

05:04.094 --> 05:07.266
- But, Daddy, my boss is...
- Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah.
- 但是，爸爸，我的老板是...
- 啊，啊，啊，啊，啊。

05:07.335 --> 05:09.956
It don't matter
who your boss is.
没关系
你的老板是谁。

05:10.025 --> 05:13.577
A good employee
follows the boss' orders.
一个好员工
听从老板的命令。

05:13.646 --> 05:15.887
If you say so, Daddy.
如果你这么说，爸爸。

05:15.956 --> 05:17.611
[rooster caws] <i>[mischievous music]</i>
[公鸡叫声]<i>[恶作剧音乐]</i>

05:17.680 --> 05:20.853
I'll just power up
the ol' rectifier...
我只需加电即可
老整流器...

05:20.922 --> 05:24.439
[grunts]
Install the free-range poultry.
[咕哝]
安装散养家禽。

05:24.508 --> 05:26.128
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:26.197 --> 05:28.473
Plus a final adjustment.
再加上最后的调整。

05:28.542 --> 05:30.163
[steps thudding]
[grunting]
[脚步声重重]
[咕噜声]

05:30.232 --> 05:32.025
Morning, Boss!
早上好，老板！

05:32.094 --> 05:33.370
Watch it!
注意！

05:33.439 --> 05:36.025
This instrument
is very delicate.
本仪器
非常精致。

05:36.094 --> 05:38.611
Can I help with the cool
science stuff today,
我可以帮忙酷吗
今天的科学知识，

05:38.680 --> 05:40.508
- Mr. Plankton?
- Please?
- 浮游生物先生？
- 请？

05:40.577 --> 05:44.163
Can you materialize me
a Krabby Patty,
你能实体化我吗
蟹肉饼，

05:44.232 --> 05:45.749
Junior Intern?
初级实习生？

05:45.818 --> 05:48.439
- No.
- Didn't think so.
- 不。
- 不这么认为。

05:48.508 --> 05:50.439
But I can give you the recipe.
但我可以给你食谱。

05:50.508 --> 05:52.301
Hummuna... wha?
胡姆纳……什么？

05:52.370 --> 05:55.577
You can get me Krabs'
你可以给我买螃蟹

05:55.646 --> 05:57.680
secret formula?
秘方？

05:57.749 --> 05:59.577
Well, he is my dad.
嗯，他是我爸爸。

05:59.646 --> 06:03.404
[blabbers]
Eugene Krabs is your father?
[喋喋不休]
尤金·克拉布斯是你的父亲吗？

06:03.473 --> 06:05.853
Duh.
Everyone knows that.
呃。
每个人都知道这一点。

06:05.922 --> 06:07.473
[stammering]
[结巴]

06:07.542 --> 06:10.577
Are you free to attend
a corporate espionage
你有空参加吗
企业间谍活动

06:10.646 --> 06:13.646
conference tonight,
"Senior Intern"?
今晚的会议，
“高级实习生”？

06:13.715 --> 06:16.232
Oh, yes!
[giggles]
哦是的！
[咯咯笑]

06:16.301 --> 06:19.059
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

06:20.749 --> 06:22.232
<i>[bright music]</i>
<i>[明亮的音乐]</i>

06:22.301 --> 06:23.542
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

06:23.611 --> 06:26.266
[smooches]
Thanks for the advice, Daddy.
[亲吻]
谢谢你的建议，爸爸。

06:26.335 --> 06:27.611
I've already got a promotion,
我已经升职了

06:27.680 --> 06:29.818
and I'm working
an extra shift tonight.
我正在工作
今晚加班。

06:29.887 --> 06:31.094
Love you!
爱你！

06:31.163 --> 06:34.542
Remember,
the boss always knows best.
请记住，
老板总是最了解的。

06:34.611 --> 06:35.956
<i>[sneaky music]</i>
<i>[偷偷摸摸的音乐]</i>

06:36.025 --> 06:38.887
Overlord to Flunky.
Come in, Flunky.
霸主对奴才。
进来吧，福兰基。

06:38.956 --> 06:42.301
Flunky here.
I read you, Overlord.
这里很狡猾。
我读懂了你，霸主。

06:42.370 --> 06:43.646
Over.
超过。

06:43.715 --> 06:45.749
Give me a boost up
to the window.
给我一个动力
到窗户。

06:45.818 --> 06:47.818
Over.
- You got it boss.
超过。
- 老板，你明白了。

06:47.887 --> 06:50.611
Over.
[strained grunts]
超过。
[紧张的咕哝声]

06:50.680 --> 06:53.025
- [screams]
- Oops!
- [尖叫]
- 哎呀！

06:53.749 --> 06:56.335
[metal clunking]
[金属碰撞声]

06:56.404 --> 06:59.335
[grunts]
Eh.
[咕哝]
呃。

06:59.404 --> 07:01.784
Ooh.
[clears throat]
哦。
[清嗓子]

07:01.853 --> 07:04.128
I forgot I had a spare key.
我忘了我有一把备用钥匙。

07:04.197 --> 07:06.370
[groans]
Come on.
[呻吟]
来吧。

07:06.439 --> 07:08.473
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

07:08.542 --> 07:10.922
Somebody's coming!
Hide.
有人来了！
隐藏。

07:10.991 --> 07:13.266
[both breathe heavily]
[两人都喘着粗气]

07:16.818 --> 07:20.473
That perforated pea-brain
should be home in bed.
那个穿孔的豌豆脑
应该回家躺在床上。

07:20.542 --> 07:22.301
Let's get out of here.
我们离开这里吧。

07:22.370 --> 07:23.646
Wait.
等待。

07:23.715 --> 07:26.991
I think SpongeBob's
sleep cooking.
我觉得海绵宝宝
睡觉做饭。

07:27.059 --> 07:29.749
[snoring]
[打鼾]

07:34.335 --> 07:38.611
SpongeBoob is even more
oblivious than usual.
海绵宝宝更是如此
比平常更健忘。

07:38.680 --> 07:40.473
[cackles]
Look!
[咯咯笑]
看！

07:40.542 --> 07:43.128
He has no idea what's going on!
他不知道发生了什么事！

07:43.197 --> 07:44.542
[chuckles]
[笑声]

07:44.611 --> 07:47.128
[grunts]
Hey, hey, hey!
[咕哝]
嘿嘿嘿！

07:47.197 --> 07:49.059
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

07:49.128 --> 07:51.335
Shh!
You're gonna wake him up!
嘘！
你要叫醒他！

07:51.404 --> 07:53.404
[laughing]
[笑]

07:53.473 --> 07:54.680
Huh?
啊？

07:54.749 --> 07:57.922
Oww!
[muffled whimpers]
哇！
[低沉的呜咽声]

07:57.991 --> 08:00.059
Over.
[whimpers]
超过。
[呜咽]

08:00.128 --> 08:02.680
[moaning]
[呻吟]

08:03.715 --> 08:07.404
Mayonnaise?
Eww!
蛋黄酱？
哇！

08:07.473 --> 08:09.266
Agh!
啊啊！

08:09.818 --> 08:12.266
[snores]
Order up!
[打鼾]
赶快下单吧！

08:13.197 --> 08:14.853
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:15.853 --> 08:19.059
[snoring]
[打鼾]

08:21.025 --> 08:24.197
Huh.
Why didn't I think of that?
呵呵。
为什么我没有想到这一点？

08:25.680 --> 08:27.646
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:27.715 --> 08:32.094
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:32.163 --> 08:33.818
[yawns]
[哈欠]

08:33.887 --> 08:36.163
Where am I?
我在哪里？

08:36.232 --> 08:37.611
[both giggling]
[gasps]
[两人都咯咯笑]
[喘气]

08:37.680 --> 08:39.508
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

08:39.577 --> 08:41.163
Ooh!
哦！

08:41.232 --> 08:43.025
Plankton!
浮游生物！

08:43.094 --> 08:44.370
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:44.439 --> 08:46.335
[slurping]
[发出声音]

08:46.404 --> 08:47.577
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

08:47.646 --> 08:50.715
[yawns] Money?
I mean, hello?
[哈欠] 钱？
我是说，你好？

08:50.784 --> 08:52.508
Mr. Krabs!
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！
蟹老板！

08:52.577 --> 08:56.473
I'm not singing you
anymore lullabies, SpongeBob.
我不是在唱你的歌
别再唱摇篮曲了，海绵宝宝。

08:56.542 --> 08:58.715
No, I'm at the Krusty Krab!
不，我在蟹堡王！

08:58.784 --> 09:00.266
Plankton and a giant goon
浮游生物和一个巨型暴徒

09:00.335 --> 09:02.680
are trying to steal
the secret formula!
正在试图偷窃
秘密配方！

09:02.749 --> 09:06.094
Me formuler?
I'll be right there, boy-o!
我的配方师？
我马上就到，小伙子！

09:06.163 --> 09:07.163
Ooh.
哦。

09:07.197 --> 09:09.025
What's your plan
to open the safe?
你的计划是什么
打开保险箱？

09:09.094 --> 09:11.887
Power drill?
Explosives?
电钻？
炸药？

09:11.956 --> 09:13.887
The Large Haddock Collider?
大型黑线鳕对撞机？

09:13.956 --> 09:16.542
Naw, I'll just use
the combination.
不，我就用
的组合。

09:16.611 --> 09:18.439
Diabolical!
恶魔！

09:18.508 --> 09:19.646
[lock whirs]
[锁呼呼]

09:19.715 --> 09:21.094
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:21.163 --> 09:24.473
I can almost taste
that Krabby Patty now!
我几乎能尝到
现在就是蟹黄派蒂了！

09:24.542 --> 09:27.059
[laughs]
The formula is mine!
[笑]
公式是我的！

09:27.128 --> 09:28.335
Nom nom!
诺姆！

09:28.404 --> 09:31.197
You'll have to get past me
first, Plankton.
你必须超越我
首先，浮游生物。

09:31.266 --> 09:32.301
Krabs!
螃蟹们！

09:32.370 --> 09:35.059
And you'll have
to get past me too!
你将会有
也能超越我！

09:35.128 --> 09:36.646
[grunts]
Ow.
[咕哝]
噢。

09:36.715 --> 09:40.163
Tell your giant goon to hand
over me formuler, Plankton!
告诉你的大暴徒
超过我的配方师，浮游生物！

09:40.232 --> 09:43.818
Daddy!
I'm a flunky, not a goon!
爸爸！
我是个小混混，不是流氓！

09:43.887 --> 09:46.128
Stay out of this, Pearl.
Pearl?
珍珠，别插手此事。
珍珠？

09:46.197 --> 09:48.197
What are you doing
with me bitter enemy?
你在做什么
与我为死敌？

09:48.266 --> 09:50.887
Working for Plankton
is my summer job.
为浮游生物工作
是我的暑期工作。

09:50.956 --> 09:53.266
I was just doing
what you said, remember?
我刚刚在做
你说的话，还记得吗？

09:53.335 --> 09:56.542
A good employee
follows their boss' orders.
一个好员工
听从老板的命令。

09:56.611 --> 09:58.956
Yeah, but... but...
but not when your boss is...
是啊，但是……但是……
但当你的老板...

09:59.025 --> 10:01.404
[groans]
Oh, me and my big mouth.
[呻吟]
哦，我和我的大嘴。

10:01.473 --> 10:04.370
Honey, you don't have to work
for this loser.
亲爱的，你不用工作
对于这个失败者。

10:04.439 --> 10:08.542
Give Papa the formuler
and you can come work for me.
把配方师交给爸爸
你可以来为我工作。

10:08.611 --> 10:10.887
You're too late, Krabs.
你来得太晚了，蟹蟹。

10:10.956 --> 10:13.577
Your daughter works for me now.
你女儿现在为我工作。

10:13.646 --> 10:17.577
I'll give you the formula
back, Daddy, on one condition.
我给你公式
回来吧，爸爸，有一个条件。

10:17.646 --> 10:19.163
Triple my allowance
我的津贴的三倍

10:19.232 --> 10:22.370
so I don't have to work
for anyone this summer.
所以我不用工作
今年夏天对任何人来说。

10:22.439 --> 10:24.335
Tri... tri... tri... triple?
三...三...三...三重？

10:24.404 --> 10:26.059
[strained grunts]
[紧张的咕哝声]

10:26.128 --> 10:29.646
[groans]
All right.
[呻吟]
好吧。

10:29.715 --> 10:32.301
Sorry, Mr. Plankton,
but I quit.
抱歉，浮游生物先生，
但我放弃了。

10:32.370 --> 10:33.749
Ah.
啊。

10:33.818 --> 10:37.197
Sweet Neptune,
she <i>is</i> gonna eat me!
甜蜜的海王星，
她<i>要吃掉我</i>！

10:39.197 --> 10:41.025
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:41.094 --> 10:43.646
You can forget
that letter of recommendation.
你可以忘记
那封推荐信。

10:43.715 --> 10:46.473
[screams, grunts]
[尖叫声、咕哝声]

10:48.646 --> 10:51.956
Sheldon, I'm back from Ma's.
谢尔顿，我从妈妈家回来了。

10:52.025 --> 10:53.853
So, how did your day go?
那么，你这一天过得怎么样？

10:53.922 --> 10:56.853
all: Hi, I'm Patrick!
全体：嗨，我是帕特里克！

10:56.922 --> 10:58.404
Don't ask.
[whimpers]
别问。
[呜咽]

别问。
[呜咽]